# AEIOS constitution

See [docs/context/RESOLVED_ARCHITECTURE.md](docs/context/RESOLVED_ARCHITECTURE.md) and [docs/context/CONFLICT_MATRIX.md](docs/context/CONFLICT_MATRIX.md). Full narrative: [docs/context/01-master-constitution.md](docs/context/01-master-constitution.md).

AEIOS is a closed-loop environmental intelligence system, not a passive logger or air-quality dashboard.

Do not collapse to: read sensors → upload → dashboard.

Preserve: sense → quality → cross-modal confidence → adaptive decision → new measurement → explanation.

Patent-relevant loops: (A) cross-modal confidence + conditional activation + VoI/energy, (B) enclosure thermal/airflow → quality, (C) GPS-less spatial reconstruction from configured coordinates.

Do not silently rewrite charter, SRS, SAD, AMP, FAS, or DOC-004. Put required edits on [docs/adr/CONTROLLED_DOC_CHANGE_QUEUE.md](docs/adr/CONTROLLED_DOC_CHANGE_QUEUE.md).

This rule does not override a controlled document.
